Actions Resource
Returns the Salesforce actions available for the user in Analytics. The entityId is the user id.
Resource URL
/wave/actions/<entityId>
Formats
JSON

Available Version
40.0

Available in Postman
To view and test a working example of this resource, see getActionCollection in Postman. For information about how to authenticate your org with Postman, see the CRM Analytics Rest API Quick Start.

